From 82c192d6d0849b65b16dd05039777afe21fb461d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 4 Jul 2026 15:13:48 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] gui: rail locked to page (no own scrollbar) + operation-mode
 transparent PNG

Shell rail: removed overflow-y:auto so the rail scrolls with the body and the
only page scrollbar is the far-right one (matches the dashboard). The framed
iframe keeps its own internal scrollbar. Also add rt_reaper.png (transparent
operation-mode diagram) wired in the prior commit.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
